        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2001, Modern Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Toilet Paper Holder features a very sleek look that is exemplified through the use of contemporary finishes and clean, sharp corners. This Deltana 55D2001 Modern Toilet Tissue Holder is available in  popular finishes. It comes with all the mounting hardware needed to install it. The Single Post Toilet Paper Holder is a great choice for any trendy bathroom remodel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2001-specifications.gif?v=1704354565\" width=\"600\" height=\"118\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Single Post L Shaped Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2001-specifications.pdf?v=1691095326\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
